Package: methodsxshortpanel
Type: Project
Title: Triangulated Temporal-Precedence Analysis for Short Panels
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: person("Zsolt T.", "Kosztyán", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "kosztyan.zsolt@gtk.uni-pannon.hu")
Description: Reference scripts, synthetic diagnostics, reviewer-driven Monte Carlo validation, benchmark comparisons, and manuscript-asset regeneration for the MethodsX short-panel temporal-precedence workflow. The R1 decision contract groups frequentist and Bayesian branches into one linear evidence family and Random Forest evidence into a second predictive/nonlinear family.
